# Context filter for `docker build -f cav21ae_dt/Dockerfile .`, read by BuildKit
# in preference to the repository's root `.dockerignore`, which it REPLACES
# rather than extends -- so this file repeats the root's entries and then adds
# back exactly what this artifact needs: its own directory, and the runner
# scripts under `script/`, which the root file excludes.  Without this the image is built
# without the experiment scripts the README tells the reader to run, and the
# build succeeds anyway, which is how the same mistake went unnoticed for a year
# in two other packages.  Requires BuildKit (the default since Docker 23.0).

.git
_build
.vscode

cav21ae_rel
popl24ae
icfp24ae
oopsla25ae
pldi26ae_lower
pldi26ae_omega
cav26ae
script/starexec
learner
script


# what this artifact runs (the root file excludes all of script/)
!script/muval_dt_eager_term_comp_20.sh
!script/muval_dt_lazy_term_comp_20.sh
!script/muval_dt_eager_term_comp_20_compare.sh
!script/muval_dt_lazy_term_comp_20_compare.sh
!script/muval_dt_term_comp_20rc
!script/para_muval_prove_disprove.sh
!script/para_aux.sh
!script/killtree.sh
